{
  "id": "conflict-push",
  "kind": "terminal",
  "language": "git",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Çakışan gönderim",
    "en": "A conflicting push"
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "remote": "https://github.com/ada/shop.git",
      "files": {
        "menu.txt": "soup 4\ntea 2\n",
        "README.md": "# Shop\n"
      },
      "message": "Open the shop",
      "author": [
        "Ada Lovelace",
        "ada@example.com"
      ]
    },
    "git clone https://github.com/ada/shop.git",
    "cd shop",
    "echo \"soup 5\" > menu.txt",
    "echo \"tea 2\" >> menu.txt",
    "git commit -am \"Raise soup price\"",
    {
      "remote": "https://github.com/ada/shop.git",
      "files": {
        "menu.txt": "soup 3\ntea 2\n",
        "README.md": "# Shop\n"
      },
      "message": "Discount soup",
      "author": [
        "Grace Hopper",
        "grace@example.com"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "cwd": "shop",
  "allow_fail": [
    0,
    1
  ],
  "solution": [
    "git push",
    "git pull --no-rebase",
    "echo \"soup 4\" > menu.txt",
    "echo \"tea 2\" >> menu.txt",
    "git add menu.txt",
    "git commit --no-edit",
    "git push"
  ],
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "push reddedilir → `git pull --no-rebase` çakışır → dosyayı düzelt, `git add`, `git commit --no-edit`, `git push`.",
      "en": "push is refused → `git pull --no-rebase` conflicts → fix the file, `git add`, `git commit --no-edit`, `git push`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı (komutları sırayla yaz):\n\n```bash\ngit push\ngit pull --no-rebase\necho \"soup 4\" > menu.txt\necho \"tea 2\" >> menu.txt\ngit add menu.txt\ngit commit --no-edit\ngit push\n```",
      "en": "The full solution (type the commands in order):\n\n```bash\ngit push\ngit pull --no-rebase\necho \"soup 4\" > menu.txt\necho \"tea 2\" >> menu.txt\ngit add menu.txt\ngit commit --no-edit\ngit push\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "shop",
      "merge_commit": true,
      "no_conflicts": true,
      "head_files": {
        "menu.txt": "soup 4\ntea 2"
      },
      "label": {
        "tr": "Birleştirme bitti: soup 4",
        "en": "Merge finished: soup 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "shop",
      "pushed": true,
      "label": {
        "tr": "GitHub güncel",
        "en": "GitHub is up to date"
      }
    }
  ]
}
